(
    title: "totp-gb",
    developer: Some("dmang-dev"),
    description: Some("TOTP (RFC 6238) two-factor authenticator for the original Game Boy, Game Boy Color, and Super Game Boy. Stores up to 8 accounts in MBC3+TIMER+RAM+BATTERY cart SRAM, uses the MBC3 hardware RTC for time, and ships a procedurally-generated SGB border with palette enhancements when run on a Super Game Boy. Two ROMs: a unified DMG/SGB build and a GBC-only build with palette swaps."),
